## Product Cluster G: Probiotics (Women’s Health)

### Neo Probiotic Femi (Lactobacillus—confirm strains)

Class and indications:
- Probiotic capsules aimed at restoring/balancing vaginal flora, commonly Lactobacillus crispatus/L. gasseri/L. jensenii–dominant profiles. Products in this category are used to support urogenital health and reduce recurrent bacterial vaginosis or yeast episodes, though strain-level evidence is critical for specific claims.

Evidence and validation:
- Species/strain composition and dosage CFU (colony-forming units) must be verified with manufacturer data or labeling before definitive clinical claims. Once validated, indications, dosing (e.g., daily for a course), and safety in pregnancy/lactation can be aligned to strain-specific evidence.

Interpretation: Probiotic efficacy is strain- and dose-specific; precise identification is non-negotiable for clinical credibility and safety assurance.

